    <briefdescription>
<para>Tracks and iterates over yield-surface activity combinations for multi-surface plasticity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Maintains a table of all <formula id="52">$2^n - 1$</formula> non-empty subsets of <computeroutput>nYieldSurfaces</computeroutput> yield surfaces and provides an interface to iterate over them during the return-mapping algorithm, marking already-tried combinations as used.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>nYieldSurfaces</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of yield surfaces. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
